01:12:04.900 --> 01:12:06.260
for an hour and 12 minutes.

01:12:06.460 --> 01:12:08.220
Is this like a Soma situation

01:12:08.220 --> 01:12:09.800
where like I just sort of

01:12:09.800 --> 01:12:13.000
I find out that spoilers for Soma,

01:12:13.980 --> 01:12:17.300
I'm actually just like an AI recreation

01:12:17.300 --> 01:12:19.920
